WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:01:27.200
[ Watch on KissFlix.co ]

2
01:27.470 --> 01:34.930
[The Great Long March]

3
01:35.330 --> 01:37.770
[Episode 9]

4
01:38.259 --> 01:40.090
[Jiaoshanpu, Guangxi, Position of the 1st Red Army Corps]

5
01:40.120 --> 01:41.750
[Mao Zhenhua, Company Commander of the 3rd Company, 1st Battalion, 4th Regiment]

6
01:40.759 --> 01:41.560
Kill them!

7
01:51.960 --> 01:56.640
[Guanghuapu, Guangxi, Position of the 3rd Red Army Corps]

8
02:06.030 --> 02:08.100
[Wang Yaonan, Commander of the Engineer Battalion, Central Revolutionary Military Commission]

9
02:45.800 --> 02:47.400
Xiang River is just ahead!

10
02:47.410 --> 02:49.960
[Kang Keqing, Zhu De's wife]

11
02:47.520 --> 02:49.120
Comrades, hurry up!

12
02:49.240 --> 02:50.960
Keep your pace. Don't stop!

13
02:50.960 --> 02:52.240
The blocking force is bleeding,

14
02:52.240 --> 02:53.680
fighting hard to hold the enemy back.

15
02:53.480 --> 02:55.390
[He Zizhen, Mao Zedong's wife]

16
02:53.680 --> 02:55.120
and walk a few minutes faster,

17
02:55.120 --> 02:56.800
fewer comrades will die!

18
02:57.680 --> 02:59.690
Comrades, let's push harder!

19
02:59.900 --> 03:02.550
[Liu Ying, Director of the Political Department of the 3rd Echelon, 2nd Column of the Military Commission]

20
03:00.150 --> 03:01.910
Crossing the Xiang River means victory!

21
03:01.910 --> 03:02.630
Push harder!

22
03:02.630 --> 03:03.910
Comrades, hurry up!

23
03:03.910 --> 03:05.360
Keep your pace. Don't stop!

24
03:05.360 --> 03:06.590
The blocking force is bleeding,

25
03:06.590 --> 03:08.150
holding the enemy back!

26
03:10.310 --> 03:11.710
Everyone, keep up!

27
03:11.730 --> 03:13.200
One, two, go!

28
03:14.400 --> 03:15.280
Push harder!

29
03:15.630 --> 03:16.870
Go!

30
03:16.620 --> 03:18.690
[Mao Zedong, Chairman of the Central Executive Committee of the Chinese Soviet Republic]

31
03:17.190 --> 03:18.870
One, two, go!

32
03:19.710 --> 03:21.190
One, two, go!

33
03:21.630 --> 03:23.120
Push it up, comrades!

34
03:28.590 --> 03:29.960
Comrades, hurry up!

35
03:29.960 --> 03:31.520
Xiang River is just ahead!

36
03:31.520 --> 03:32.840
Comrades, march faster!

37
03:32.840 --> 03:34.310
Keep your pace. Don't stop!

38
03:34.310 --> 03:35.560
The blocking force is bleeding.

39
03:35.560 --> 03:37.000
If we sweat a little more today,

40
03:37.000 --> 03:38.430
and walk a few minutes faster,

41
03:38.430 --> 03:40.120
fewer comrades will die!

42
03:42.180 --> 03:44.579
Comrade Li De, the situation is very critical.

43
03:43.250 --> 03:45.790
[Li De, Military Adviser of the Communist International]

44
03:45.030 --> 03:46.590
If we keep moving at this pace,

45
03:45.960 --> 03:47.610
[Zhou Enlai, CPC Central Committee Politburo Standing Committee, Vice-Chairman of the Central Revolutionary Military Commission, General Political Commissar of the Chinese Workers' and Peasants' Red Army]

46
03:46.710 --> 03:48.840
the consequences will be disastrous.

47
03:49.000 --> 03:50.520
That's not my responsibility, Zhou Enlai.

48
03:50.520 --> 03:51.520
That's not my responsibility.

49
03:51.520 --> 03:53.240
It's the responsibility of the 1st and 3rd Red Army Corps.

50
03:52.990 --> 03:54.400
[Bo Gu (Qin Bangxian), Head of the CPC Central Committee]

51
03:53.240 --> 03:54.590
It's the responsibility of the 1st and 3rd Red Army Corps.

52
03:54.590 --> 03:56.840
Their mission is to hold the crossing.

53
03:56.840 --> 03:58.470
Their mission is to hold the crossing.

54
03:58.470 --> 04:00.000
If they can't hold it,

55
04:00.120 --> 04:01.520
then that's their own fault.

56
04:01.520 --> 04:03.710
The failure is on Lin Biao and Peng Dehuai!

57
04:03.710 --> 04:04.560
If they can't hold it,

58
04:04.560 --> 04:05.590
then that's their own fault.

59
04:05.590 --> 04:07.050
The failure is on Lin Biao and Peng Dehuai!

60
04:07.050 --> 04:07.850
Comrade Li De!

61
04:07.850 --> 04:10.590
[Zhu De, Chairman of the Central Revolutionary Military Commission (CRMC); Commander-in-Chief of the Red Army]

62
04:07.960 --> 04:09.310
The 1st and 3rd Red Army Corps

63
04:09.310 --> 04:10.840
have been fighting an enemy

64
04:11.400 --> 04:12.960
several times their size for two days.

65
04:12.960 --> 04:14.240
Every single minute now

66
04:14.240 --> 04:16.510
is bought with our soldiers' blood and lives.

67
04:16.510 --> 04:17.910
Stop arguing, everyone.

68
04:19.550 --> 04:20.670
Enemy planes!

69
04:20.700 --> 04:21.779
Take cover!

70
04:22.870 --> 04:24.600
Chairman! Chairman!

71
04:25.000 --> 04:26.070
Take cover!

72
04:30.190 --> 04:31.270
Get down! Get down!

73
04:31.630 --> 04:32.110
Hurry!

74
04:33.040 --> 04:33.500
Careful!

75
04:33.500 --> 04:35.010
Don't panic, everyone!

76
04:35.360 --> 04:36.430
Don't panic!

77
04:36.560 --> 04:37.060
Get down!

78
04:37.060 --> 04:38.650
Put the supplies down!

79
04:38.680 --> 04:41.140
Drop the heavy stuff! Get the people across!

80
04:41.920 --> 04:42.520
Changbao!

81
04:43.120 --> 04:43.720
Changbao!

82
04:44.250 --> 04:45.050
Tell everyone

83
04:45.870 --> 04:47.400
to drop the heavy supplies!

84
04:48.470 --> 04:51.400
Drop them! They're not important! Take cover first!

85
04:52.870 --> 04:53.950
Recon planes.

86
04:54.390 --> 04:56.120
Comrades, don't panic!

87
04:56.500 --> 04:58.060
Those are enemy recon planes!

88
04:58.060 --> 04:59.190
Everything is fine!

89
05:04.920 --> 05:05.830
Comrade Li De,

90
05:06.480 --> 05:08.080
tell us what we should do now.

91
05:12.430 --> 05:14.040
Say something, Comrade Li De.

92
05:14.040 --> 05:16.520
I don't know.

93
05:16.540 --> 05:17.770
I don't know, Bo Gu.

94
05:18.050 --> 05:20.010
I can't command such idiots!

95
05:20.040 --> 05:21.890
They have no understanding of my tactics!

96
05:21.890 --> 05:22.980
Comrade Li De!

97
05:23.810 --> 05:24.980
What did he just say?

98
05:24.700 --> 05:25.600
[Wu Xiuquan, Translator]

99
05:27.910 --> 05:29.260
What did he just say?

100
05:32.840 --> 05:35.570
He said we have no understanding of his tactics.

101
05:38.950 --> 05:40.130
Our top priority right now

102
05:40.130 --> 05:41.610
is to speed up the march.

103
05:41.750 --> 05:43.550
Speeding up is Zhou Enlai's job.

104
05:52.040 --> 05:53.680
What do we do now?

105
05:57.400 --> 05:59.430
Let's just all do our best.

106
05:59.800 --> 06:02.090
We'll break out as many as we can.

107
06:02.560 --> 06:04.160
If we really want to speed up,

108
06:04.680 --> 06:06.160
we have to abandon some heavy supplies.

109
06:06.160 --> 06:07.290
That's the only way.

110
06:07.300 --> 06:09.470
Alright, drop whatever we can.

111
06:09.920 --> 06:11.180
Speed is what matters.

112
06:11.400 --> 06:12.810
I'll go direct the river crossing.

113
06:12.810 --> 06:13.690
Be careful.

114
06:18.160 --> 06:19.580
Comrade Bo Gu, Comrade Li De.

115
06:19.580 --> 06:20.370
you need to stay calm.

116
06:20.370 --> 06:21.840
I still have the guard unit.

117
06:21.840 --> 06:23.970
We still have the guard unit.

118
06:23.990 --> 06:26.220
And you should think carefully:

119
06:26.320 --> 06:28.320
Was Mao's suggestion at Wenshi Town

120
06:28.590 --> 06:30.030
really just a fantasy?

121
06:45.010 --> 06:49.909
[Guanghuapu, Guangxi, Position of the 3rd Red Army Corps]

122
06:48.360 --> 06:48.830
Comrade!

123
06:48.830 --> 06:49.750
He's still alive!

124
06:49.750 --> 06:51.070
-Quick! -Okay.

125
06:51.720 --> 06:52.390
Comrade!

126
06:53.390 --> 06:54.390
How are you doing?

127
06:54.920 --> 06:55.920
Let me help you up.

128
06:55.920 --> 06:56.380
Come on.

129
06:57.040 --> 06:57.570
Easy now.

130
07:02.830 --> 07:03.430
Follow me.

131
07:05.750 --> 07:06.610
Give me the gun.

132
07:13.200 --> 07:13.810
Get up.

133
07:18.970 --> 07:20.230
I need another hand here!

134
07:20.230 --> 07:22.090
Someone's still alive over here!

135
07:30.680 --> 07:32.510
Come on.

136
07:32.510 --> 07:33.190
Easy now.

137
07:41.620 --> 07:43.350
Commander, why are you up here?

138
07:43.820 --> 07:45.110
Can you still hold them?

139
07:45.110 --> 07:46.130
Don't worry, Commander!

140
07:46.130 --> 07:47.490
Unless the 10th Regiment is completely wiped out,

141
07:46.690 --> 07:49.300
[Yang Yong, Political Commissar of the 10th Regiment, 4th Division, 3rd Red Army Corps]

142
07:47.570 --> 07:49.480
even if only one man and one bullet are left,

143
07:49.480 --> 07:51.210
we won't lose an inch of ground!

144
07:54.680 --> 07:56.210
Quick, prepare for battle!

145
08:12.630 --> 08:13.890
Beat the enemies back!

146
08:14.040 --> 08:14.750
Yes, sir!

147
08:20.080 --> 08:22.210
Get me the 4th Division Headquarters.

148
08:26.270 --> 08:26.870
Hello,

149
08:27.680 --> 08:28.540
Huang Kecheng?

150
08:28.650 --> 08:29.970
Commander!

151
08:30.000 --> 08:31.670
The 10th Regiment Commander has been killed in action.

152
08:31.670 --> 08:33.289
I know Shen Shuqing was killed.

153
08:33.289 --> 08:37.320
[Peng Dehuai Commander of the 3rd Red Army Corps]

154
08:33.530 --> 08:35.440
Didn't I ask Du Zhongmei

155
08:35.510 --> 08:36.850
to take over as acting commander?

156
08:36.850 --> 08:38.090
He was killed too!

157
08:44.680 --> 08:45.680
He was killed too.

158
08:45.830 --> 08:47.310
[Yang Shangkun, Political Commissar of the 3rd Red Army Corps]

159
08:53.460 --> 08:56.030
What? Say that again!

160
08:57.660 --> 09:01.120
[Deng Ping, Chief of Staff of 3rd Red Army Corps]

161
09:06.080 --> 09:07.480
Report from the 5th Division:

162
09:07.480 --> 09:09.740
Under the cover of planes and artillery,

163
09:09.750 --> 09:12.960
the Guangxi Army launched charges

164
09:12.960 --> 09:15.420
against the Xinxu positions from all sides.

165
09:15.740 --> 09:17.140
What are the casualties?

166
09:18.530 --> 09:21.860
The 5th Division Chief of Staff, Comrade Hu Jun, was killed.

167
09:22.080 --> 09:24.460
The 14th Regiment Political Commissar was severely wounded.

168
09:24.460 --> 09:25.880
Regiment Commander Huang Mianchang,

169
09:25.880 --> 09:27.060
the Deputy Commander,

170
09:27.060 --> 09:28.230
the Chief of Staff,

171
09:28.870 --> 09:30.400
and the Director of the Political Department

172
09:30.400 --> 09:31.760
were all killed.

173
09:33.050 --> 09:35.250
The 15th Regiment Commander Bai Zhiwen

174
09:35.490 --> 09:38.390
and Political Commissar Luo Yuanfa were severely wounded.

175
09:38.390 --> 09:41.540
The two regiments suffered no less than 2000 casualties.

176
09:41.540 --> 09:44.540
Most officers below the battalion level were killed.

177
09:44.840 --> 09:47.270
Zhong Chibing and Li Tianyou

178
09:47.960 --> 09:49.390
have gone up to the frontline

179
09:49.390 --> 09:52.320
to separately command the two regiments in defense.

180
09:52.750 --> 09:54.650
If this battle continues like this,

181
09:54.650 --> 09:56.850
the entire field army will be wiped out!

182
10:02.620 --> 10:06.220
Right or wrong, let history be the judge.

183
10:07.880 --> 10:10.010
But now, we must not let our guard down.

184
10:10.360 --> 10:12.020
We absolutely cannot falter.

185
10:12.240 --> 10:13.790
We must safely

186
10:13.810 --> 10:17.100
escort the Central and Military Commission Columns across the river!

187
10:17.100 --> 10:21.730
[Frontline Headquarters of the Hunan Army, Guangxi]

188
10:17.160 --> 10:18.160
Commander-in-Chief,

189
10:18.160 --> 10:19.630
we've attacked over a dozen times,

190
10:19.630 --> 10:21.290
but we just can't take it down!

191
10:21.800 --> 10:22.590
Useless!

192
10:26.320 --> 10:27.120
Hold on.

193
10:27.600 --> 10:30.530
Commander-in-Chief, it's Commander He on the line.

194
10:32.650 --> 10:36.110
[Liu Jianxu, Commander of the 1st Column of the KMT troops' Western Route Army]

195
10:34.550 --> 10:35.270
Hello?

196
10:35.540 --> 10:36.530
Huixian?

197
10:36.630 --> 10:38.360
How is the battle progressing?

198
10:38.750 --> 10:39.480
Commander,

199
10:40.000 --> 10:42.200
I've launched dozens of mass charges

200
10:42.090 --> 10:46.030
[He Jian, Commander-in-Chief of the Nationalist Pursuit Army and Chairman of the Hunan Provincial Government]

201
10:42.200 --> 10:45.060
against the Communist defense line at Jiaoshanpu!

202
10:45.250 --> 10:47.400
But they are fighting like madmen,

203
10:48.080 --> 10:49.910
fighting to the death without retreating!

204
10:49.910 --> 10:52.910
But we aren't the only ones stuck.

205
10:53.200 --> 10:55.320
The Guangxi Army at Guanghuapu

206
10:55.360 --> 10:56.210
and Xinxu

207
10:56.630 --> 10:58.820
is also stuck, just like us!

208
10:59.320 --> 11:01.080
I don't care about the Guangxi Army!

209
11:01.080 --> 11:04.320
Our Hunan Army's offensive must not slacken.

210
11:04.560 --> 11:05.560
Don't forget that

211
11:05.900 --> 11:09.020
our Hunan Army made its name by suppressing the Communists!

212
11:09.020 --> 11:10.500
If Quanzhou falls,

213
11:11.320 --> 11:13.200
the Communist main force will enter Hunan

214
11:13.200 --> 11:15.440
and join up with He Long and Xiao Ke.

215
11:15.570 --> 11:18.970
Today's Hunan will become yesterday's Jiangxi!

216
11:34.250 --> 11:35.360
Order Li Jue

217
11:38.090 --> 11:40.760
to send all four replacement regiments up!

218
11:40.920 --> 11:41.980
Leave no reserves!

219
11:42.120 --> 11:44.300
And send a telegram to the air force in Hengyang.

220
11:44.300 --> 11:46.370
Tell them to drop all their aerial bombs and incendiaries

221
11:46.370 --> 11:48.850
on the banks of the Xiang River,

222
11:49.790 --> 11:51.490
right on the Communist soldiers' heads!

223
11:51.490 --> 11:52.440
Yes, sir!

224
11:52.900 --> 11:57.550
[Jiaoshanpu, Guangxi, Position of the 1st Red Army Corps]

225
11:54.190 --> 11:56.150
Intelligence from all regiments has been compiled.

226
11:56.150 --> 11:57.750
The Hunan Army attacking us head-on

227
11:57.750 --> 11:59.440
is far more than the previous three regiments.

228
11:57.860 --> 11:59.290
[Nie Rongzhen, Political Commissar of the 1st Red Army Corps]

229
11:59.300 --> 12:01.460
[Lin Biao, Commander of the 1st Red Army Corps]

230
11:59.440 --> 12:01.630
There are at least ten regiments' worth of troops!

231
12:01.630 --> 12:02.320
Furthermore,

232
12:02.130 --> 12:04.740
[Zuo Quan, Chief of Staff of the 1st Red Army Corps]

233
12:02.340 --> 12:04.300
Xue Yue's troops are moving along the Hunan-Guangxi Highway

234
12:04.300 --> 12:05.370
to close in on us.

235
12:06.720 --> 12:08.960
We should report this to the Military Commission immediately.

236
12:08.960 --> 12:10.180
What's the use of reporting?

237
12:10.180 --> 12:11.910
Can they send reinforcements?

238
12:12.120 --> 12:13.410
The only thing they should be doing now

239
12:13.410 --> 12:14.470
is walking faster.

240
12:18.890 --> 12:19.890
This is Zuo Quan.

241
12:21.000 --> 12:21.960
Li Jukui?

242
12:22.680 --> 12:23.610
You've arrived?

243
12:23.610 --> 12:25.690
Good. How are the troops doing?

244
12:26.720 --> 12:27.650
Very exhausted.

245
12:32.190 --> 12:33.950
Li Jukui, this is Lin Biao.

246
12:34.400 --> 12:35.990
I have no time to let you rest.

247
12:35.990 --> 12:37.270
The two regiments of your 1st Division

248
12:37.270 --> 12:38.650
must enter the defensive positions

249
12:38.650 --> 12:39.870
and join the battle now!

250
12:39.870 --> 12:42.200
Commander, how long do we need to hold them?

251
12:42.200 --> 12:43.670
Hold them to the last man,

252
12:43.890 --> 12:45.350
until you receive the order to retreat.

253
12:45.350 --> 12:48.210
Yes, sir! We will absolutely complete the mission!

254
12:49.690 --> 12:52.420
I'll go to the 2nd Division and command directly.

255
12:56.920 --> 12:59.360
Zuo Quan, tell me.

256
13:00.240 --> 13:03.150
If Chairman Mao were commanding this battle,

257
13:03.350 --> 13:04.550
how would he fight it?

258
13:05.420 --> 13:07.780
He would never let us cross the Xiang River

259
13:08.530 --> 13:10.590
and walk right into the enemy's trap.

260
13:14.760 --> 13:20.280
[Jieshou Ferry, Xiang River, Guangxi]

261
13:19.750 --> 13:21.440
Comrades, keep up!

262
13:22.000 --> 13:24.350
The Central and Military Commission Columns are here!

263
13:24.350 --> 13:27.740
Comrades, get down and secure the bridge!

264
13:24.510 --> 13:26.650
[Chen Geng, head of the Cadre Regiment of the 1st Military Commission Column]

265
13:40.470 --> 13:41.600
Vice Chairman Zhou!

266
13:42.130 --> 13:44.440
Vice Chairman Zhou, you're finally here!

267
13:44.440 --> 13:45.840
Quick, cross the bridge!

268
13:46.200 --> 13:47.860
The bombers will be here soon!

269
13:51.420 --> 13:52.350
Comrades!

270
13:52.450 --> 13:54.520
Stay in order, and stick to your units!

271
13:54.520 --> 13:55.520
Don't rush!

272
13:55.670 --> 13:57.360
It's safe for now.

273
13:59.140 --> 14:01.320
[Deng Yingchao, Secretary of the Political Bureau of the CPC Central Committee]

274
14:04.270 --> 14:05.340
Keep up!

275
14:12.120 --> 14:14.000
Don't fall behind. Keep up!

276
14:20.200 --> 14:21.150
Hurry up!

277
14:21.960 --> 14:22.750
Be careful!

278
14:25.000 --> 14:25.790
Come on!

279
14:26.170 --> 14:27.370
Speed up at the front!

280
14:29.600 --> 14:30.440
Be careful!

281
14:31.390 --> 14:34.440
Xiwa! Xiwa! Xiwa!

282
14:35.120 --> 14:36.630
Don't panic! Don't panic!

283
14:36.800 --> 14:38.170
Xiwa! Xiwa!

284
14:38.440 --> 14:39.300
I'll carry him!

285
14:39.360 --> 14:40.020
Let me do it.

286
14:40.620 --> 14:41.720
Lift him onto my back!

287
14:41.720 --> 14:42.700
Come on, give me a hand.

288
14:42.700 --> 14:44.910
One, two, three!

289
14:47.050 --> 14:47.890
I'm good.

290
14:48.380 --> 14:50.570
Go! Go!

291
14:58.210 --> 15:00.350
[Xie Juezai, Member of the Central Work Group of the Red Army General Health Department and Lin Boqu, Director of the General Confiscation and Requisition Committee of the Central Revolutionary Military Commission]

292
15:00.700 --> 15:03.480
[Xu Teli, Deputy Director of the Central Work Group of the Red Army General Health Department]

293
15:04.250 --> 15:04.960
Keep up.

294
15:05.280 --> 15:06.160
Keep up!

295
15:09.470 --> 15:16.350
[Xinxu, Guangxi, Blocking Position of the 5th Division, 3rd Red Army Corps]

296
15:18.750 --> 15:19.550
Comrade!

297
15:19.990 --> 15:20.750
Comrade!

298
15:20.970 --> 15:22.450
Sir. Hang in there.

299
15:22.720 --> 15:23.720
Hang in there!

300
15:25.290 --> 15:26.370
Hang in there!

301
15:26.890 --> 15:29.260
[Li Tianyou, Commander of the 5th Division, 3rd Red Army Corps]

302
15:30.080 --> 15:30.810
Give it to me.

303
15:32.660 --> 15:33.420
Does it hurt?

304
15:33.680 --> 15:34.280
Not...

305
15:35.220 --> 15:35.900
much.

306
15:44.550 --> 15:47.120
Seeing how petite you are,

307
15:47.220 --> 15:50.170
I worry you lack the strength for the fields.

308
15:50.820 --> 15:54.110
I plow with the strength of a tiger,

309
15:54.310 --> 15:57.160
carrying the plow with my head bowed low.

310
15:57.960 --> 15:59.270
Oh, my dear girl.

311
15:59.290 --> 16:01.860
Carrying the plow with my head bowed low.

312
16:02.710 --> 16:06.240
Seeing how petite you are,

313
16:06.440 --> 16:09.720
I worry you lack the strength for the fields.

314
16:10.120 --> 16:13.160
I plow with the strength of a tiger,

315
16:13.480 --> 16:16.360
carrying the plow with my head bowed low.

316
16:16.720 --> 16:18.240
Oh, my dear girl.

317
16:18.270 --> 16:21.080
Carrying the plow with my head bowed low.

318
16:21.100 --> 16:23.100
Red Army brothers over there!

319
16:23.550 --> 16:24.840
We know

320
16:25.150 --> 16:27.600
many of you are from Guangxi!

321
16:28.290 --> 16:31.020
Guangxi soldiers don't fight Guangxi soldiers!

322
16:31.110 --> 16:34.300
Bastards, trying to play mind games.

323
16:34.890 --> 16:36.340
Listen to me!

324
16:36.870 --> 16:39.720
I am Li Tianyou!

325
16:40.240 --> 16:41.480
Li Tianyou!

326
16:41.840 --> 16:43.240
Division Commander Li!

327
16:43.550 --> 16:47.150
Commander Bai sent a telegram from Guilin!

328
16:47.460 --> 16:52.230
He said, as long as you abandon the darkness

329
16:52.470 --> 16:54.680
and return to our Guangxi Army,

330
16:55.260 --> 16:58.980
he guarantees you'll be made a general!

331
17:04.160 --> 17:05.560
Guangxi Army over there!

332
17:05.920 --> 17:07.770
I am a Guangxi boy!

333
17:08.829 --> 17:10.160
A boy from a poor family!

334
17:11.109 --> 17:12.790
Brothers of the Guangxi Army!

335
17:13.560 --> 17:15.119
How many of you

336
17:15.770 --> 17:17.819
are sons of rich landlords?

337
17:18.640 --> 17:21.640
Aren't your parents all poor folks?

338
17:22.400 --> 17:23.800
Which one of your parents

339
17:24.030 --> 17:26.720
hasn't been oppressed by the rich landlords?

340
17:27.440 --> 17:29.900
You help Chiang Kai-shek fight the Red Army,

341
17:30.440 --> 17:32.030
helping the rich landlords

342
17:32.340 --> 17:34.180
bully the army of the poor!

343
17:34.530 --> 17:37.010
Is that fair to your own conscience?

344
17:37.830 --> 17:39.590
If you still have a conscience,

345
17:40.110 --> 17:41.350
get the hell back!

346
17:42.160 --> 17:43.750
If you want to fight,

347
17:44.170 --> 17:45.650
just come on up!

348
17:46.310 --> 17:48.660
We'll fight to the death!

349
17:52.510 --> 17:56.000
Comrades, come and take your guns

350
17:56.250 --> 17:59.730
We are the arms of the farmers

351
18:00.200 --> 18:03.880
To destroy the imperialism national party

352
18:04.070 --> 18:07.720
To create the Sylvie Republic

353
18:07.960 --> 18:09.510
The enemy is shaking

354
18:09.830 --> 18:11.350
Keep going

355
18:11.680 --> 18:13.440
We are invincible

356
18:13.330 --> 18:20.080
[Jianfengling, Jiaoshanpu, Guangxi, Position of the 5th Regiment, 2nd Division, 1st Red Army Corps]

357
18:16.060 --> 18:16.890
Here you are.

358
18:23.640 --> 18:23.970
Here.

359
18:24.000 --> 18:24.660
Commissar.

360
18:25.750 --> 18:26.610
I'm not hungry.

361
18:26.660 --> 18:28.060
Save it for the soldiers.

362
18:29.920 --> 18:30.790
Is there enough for everyone?

363
18:30.790 --> 18:31.590
Yes, there is.

364
18:31.800 --> 18:32.600
Eat a bit more.

365
18:33.210 --> 18:35.720
Commissar, the Regiment Commander has been sent down.

366
18:33.240 --> 18:35.110
[Yi Dangping, Political Commissar of the 5th Regiment, 2nd Division, 1st Red Army Corps]

367
18:35.790 --> 18:36.310
Good.

368
18:36.440 --> 18:38.300
We also collected a batch of ammo.

369
18:39.340 --> 18:41.860
We saw the 4th Regiment sending people down too.

370
18:40.390 --> 18:41.770
[Chen Fangren, Instructor of 5th Company, 2nd Battalion, 5th Regiment, 2nd Division, 1st Red Army Corps]

371
18:43.400 --> 18:45.060
How is the 4th Regiment doing?

372
18:46.310 --> 18:47.840
They are fighting a very hard battle.

373
18:47.840 --> 18:50.970
The entire regiment has suffered over half casualties.

374
18:51.940 --> 18:52.900
Understood.

375
18:54.680 --> 18:55.750
Commissar, I just don't understand.

376
18:55.750 --> 18:56.610
Why?

377
18:57.750 --> 19:00.010
Why has this battle turned out like this?

378
19:32.670 --> 19:33.710
Comrades!

379
19:34.980 --> 19:36.330
What does this flag

380
19:38.440 --> 19:40.070
represent?

381
19:46.310 --> 19:47.400
Our regiment

382
19:47.970 --> 19:50.370
was founded during the Nanchang Uprising.

383
19:51.000 --> 19:52.730
It later merged with the troops

384
19:53.200 --> 19:55.730
Commissar Mao led up the Jinggang Mountains.

385
19:57.640 --> 20:01.750
This flag represents honor!

386
20:02.510 --> 20:04.510
It also represents determination!

387
20:04.880 --> 20:07.720
The martyrs of our 5th Regiment who sacrificed their lives are all on it.

388
20:07.720 --> 20:09.430
They are watching us!

389
20:10.640 --> 20:12.190
Even if we are all wiped out,

390
20:12.270 --> 20:13.580
we must hold the enemy back

391
20:13.580 --> 20:16.240
and ensure our comrades cross the river safely!

392
20:16.360 --> 20:17.520
No matter how difficult it is,

393
20:17.520 --> 20:19.040
we must hold our ground

394
20:19.310 --> 20:22.320
to pave a path of survival for our comrades!

395
20:23.830 --> 20:24.790
Commissar,

396
20:26.680 --> 20:27.880
we understand.

397
20:28.390 --> 20:30.230
Even if we are all wiped out,

398
20:30.680 --> 20:33.200
we'll pave a path of survival for our comrades!

399
20:33.200 --> 20:35.110
Right, let's fight them to the death!

400
20:35.110 --> 20:36.770
Let's fight them to the death!

401
20:38.030 --> 20:38.490
Keep up!

402
20:38.550 --> 20:39.480
Watch your step!

403
20:39.920 --> 20:40.550
Watch your step!

404
20:40.550 --> 20:40.920
Speed up!

405
20:40.920 --> 20:41.960
Faster! Faster!

406
20:42.640 --> 20:43.350
Watch your step!

407
20:43.350 --> 20:44.030
Keep up, quick!

408
20:44.030 --> 20:44.590
Faster!

409
20:44.590 --> 20:45.050
Keep up!

410
20:45.070 --> 20:46.000
Watch your step!

411
20:46.110 --> 20:46.570
Keep up!

412
20:46.640 --> 20:47.570
Watch your step!

413
20:47.880 --> 20:48.830
Watch your step!

414
20:53.200 --> 20:54.440
I'm coming, I'm coming!

415
20:54.440 --> 20:55.120
Speed up!

416
20:55.270 --> 20:56.750
One, two, three!

417
20:59.030 --> 21:00.510
One, two, three!

418
21:03.750 --> 21:04.960
Enemy planes!

419
21:05.200 --> 21:07.480
Get out of here, quick!

420
21:15.190 --> 21:16.650
Come on, push hard!

421
21:16.680 --> 21:17.750
One, two!

422
21:48.470 --> 21:53.650
[Jianfengling, Jiaoshanpu, Guangxi, Position of the 5th Regiment, 2nd Division, 1st Red Army Corps]

423
21:49.200 --> 21:50.930
The enemy is pressing up again!

424
21:51.310 --> 21:52.270
Comrades!

425
21:52.840 --> 21:54.360
We march to our deaths

426
21:54.720 --> 21:57.120
to pave a path of survival for our comrades!

427
21:57.350 --> 21:59.790
Charge!

428
22:00.510 --> 22:01.310
Charge!

429
22:05.650 --> 22:11.710
[Xinxu, Guangxi, Blocking Position of the 5th Division, 3rd Red Army Corps]

430
22:05.880 --> 22:06.830
Go!

431
22:06.960 --> 22:09.030
Charge!

432
23:15.540 --> 23:16.210
The radio!

433
23:16.640 --> 23:17.640
That's the radio!

434
23:17.640 --> 23:20.080
It's the only long-range radio we have!

435
23:20.830 --> 23:21.620
Without it,

436
23:22.480 --> 23:24.500
how do I contact the Shanghai station?

437
23:24.500 --> 23:26.460
How do I contact Moscow?

438
23:29.830 --> 23:35.220
[Guanghuapu, Guangxi, Position of the 3rd Red Army Corps]

439
23:37.260 --> 23:42.760
[Jiaoshanpu, Guangxi, Position of the 1st Red Army Corps]

440
23:53.210 --> 23:58.510
[Guanghuapu, Guangxi, Position of the 3rd Red Army Corps]

441
23:59.810 --> 24:03.480
[Jieshou Ferry, Xiang River, Guangxi]

442
24:43.400 --> 24:44.560
Xie!

443
24:45.130 --> 24:47.130
Xie, get down!

444
25:05.430 --> 25:08.600
Xie! Xie!

445
25:11.010 --> 25:14.250
Xie!

446
25:14.770 --> 25:20.070
[Xinxu, Guangxi, Blocking Position of the 5th Division, 3rd Red Army Corps]

447
25:22.490 --> 25:23.570
Gou Yazi, quick!

448
25:29.670 --> 25:30.560
Quick!

449
25:48.910 --> 25:49.990
Get up!

450
25:51.250 --> 25:52.530
Get up!

451
26:31.400 --> 26:37.400
[34th Red Division Positions, Shuiche Area, Guanyang, Guangxi]

452
27:08.580 --> 27:09.650
Division Commander,

453
27:09.650 --> 27:12.710
we've repelled the enemy's attacks over a dozen times!

454
27:27.600 --> 27:29.660
[Chen Shuxiang, Commander of the 34th Division, 5th Red Army Corps]

455
27:46.160 --> 27:47.560
Let me stop the bleeding first.

456
27:47.560 --> 27:49.490
You'll be fine once it's bandaged.

457
27:49.550 --> 27:50.480
Don't be afraid.

458
27:50.640 --> 27:52.580
It's just a scratch. A bandage is enough.

459
27:52.580 --> 27:54.310
It's a scratch, just a scratch.

460
27:55.010 --> 27:55.870
Just a scratch.

461
27:57.670 --> 27:58.200
There, there.

462
27:58.200 --> 27:59.400
Division Commander.

463
28:00.960 --> 28:02.160
Bear with it for a bit.

464
28:04.780 --> 28:05.510
Does it hurt?

465
28:06.920 --> 28:08.450
It doesn't hurt. Not at all.

466
28:09.790 --> 28:10.990
If it hurts, just cry.

467
28:13.200 --> 28:14.770
I am a Red Army soldier!

468
28:15.440 --> 28:17.100
Red Army soldiers can cry too.

469
28:17.310 --> 28:19.240
When people get hurt, they want to cry.

470
28:19.240 --> 28:20.900
If you want to cry, cry loudly.

471
28:21.310 --> 28:22.810
You're still a hero even if you cry.

472
28:22.810 --> 28:25.670
The Division Commander told you to cry, so just cry!

473
28:25.670 --> 28:26.160
Cry!

474
28:28.210 --> 28:29.210
Bear with it.

475
28:32.390 --> 28:33.270
Hang in there.

476
28:36.700 --> 28:37.350
All done.

477
28:39.830 --> 28:41.090
I'm afraid of pain too.

478
28:41.440 --> 28:44.310
When I was a kid, I stole wild honey,

479
28:44.720 --> 28:46.480
and got stung right on my butt.

480
28:46.960 --> 28:48.960
It hurt so much I cried the whole day!

481
28:50.050 --> 28:52.130
Another time, I was in town,

482
28:53.200 --> 28:55.400
and I saw someone selling dried sweet potatoes.

483
28:55.400 --> 28:58.590
From a distance, they looked so golden and bright.

484
28:58.610 --> 29:00.010
They looked so delicious.

485
29:00.010 --> 29:01.540
I was craving them so badly!

486
29:03.190 --> 29:05.320
But I had no money, so I asked the vendor

487
29:05.440 --> 29:07.830
how to make these?

488
29:08.110 --> 29:10.620
He said, first you steam them, then...

489
29:11.360 --> 29:12.750
dry them in the sun.

490
29:13.350 --> 29:15.240
I ran all the way back to our field,

491
29:15.320 --> 29:16.980
dug up all the sweet potatoes,

492
29:17.070 --> 29:18.070
and steamed them.

493
29:18.270 --> 29:20.400
Division Commander, did you succeed?

494
29:20.800 --> 29:22.490
You're all hungry?

495
29:22.550 --> 29:23.400
Yes.

496
29:23.750 --> 29:24.550
Craving it?

497
29:25.270 --> 29:26.070
I failed.

498
29:26.720 --> 29:30.250
The fire was too big, and they all turned into sweet potato mash.

499
29:34.160 --> 29:35.550
What happened later, Division Commander?

500
29:35.550 --> 29:36.400
Later?

501
29:37.720 --> 29:39.270
Then my dad came home.

502
29:39.720 --> 29:42.120
He saw I had steamed all the sweet potatoes,

503
29:42.880 --> 29:44.030
and he was furious!

504
29:44.550 --> 29:47.280
He grabbed a bamboo cane and beat me mercilessly.

505
29:47.680 --> 29:49.340
I was stubborn, just like you.

506
29:49.720 --> 29:51.110
I didn't make a sound.

507
29:51.420 --> 29:53.480
He beat me until my skin was torn open.

508
29:54.030 --> 29:55.590
My dad cried instead.

509
29:56.270 --> 29:57.510
Later my dad asked me,

510
29:57.720 --> 29:59.430
Why didn't you cry?

511
30:00.000 --> 30:02.200
When I hit you, if you had cried,

512
30:02.710 --> 30:05.440
I wouldn't have had the heart to keep hitting you.

513
30:06.640 --> 30:09.320
Division Commander, what happened after that?

514
30:09.490 --> 30:11.350
Did you eat dried sweet potatoes?

515
30:11.480 --> 30:12.350
After that...

516
30:12.830 --> 30:13.880
our whole family

517
30:13.920 --> 30:15.510
ate sweet potato porridge for ten days.

518
30:15.510 --> 30:16.160
Ten days?

519
30:16.180 --> 30:17.070
Ten days!

520
30:19.310 --> 30:20.510
Division Commander,

521
30:20.620 --> 30:23.620
were they sweet?

522
30:23.910 --> 30:24.840
Yes, very sweet.

523
30:25.280 --> 30:28.010
When we return to our hometown in western Fujian,

524
30:28.140 --> 30:30.440
I'll have my mom make dried sweet potatoes for us.

525
30:30.440 --> 30:33.570
My mom makes the best dried sweet potatoes.

526
30:34.230 --> 30:37.600
Alright, we'll go back with you to eat them.

527
30:53.810 --> 30:54.850
Zhenglin!

528
30:55.690 --> 30:56.860
Zhenglin!

529
31:15.240 --> 31:23.560
♪ Little stars, little stars, fill the sky ♪

530
31:21.830 --> 31:23.830
He was my machine gun squad leader.

531
31:24.490 --> 31:33.190
♪ Fly to the west bank of Yongxin River ♪

532
31:26.000 --> 31:27.270
Actually, his parents

533
31:29.000 --> 31:30.350
died very early.

534
31:31.510 --> 31:33.640
He joined the army with me at thirteen.

535
31:34.480 --> 31:38.150
♪ One to the east ♪

536
31:35.270 --> 31:37.600
He would have been seventeen in a few days.

537
31:38.640 --> 31:42.650
♪ One to the west ♪

538
31:43.660 --> 31:52.720
♪ Count and count, there's no end in sight ♪

539
31:53.460 --> 32:02.140
♪ Mama calls me home for supper ♪

540
32:03.050 --> 32:11.070
♪ And I want to count the stars above ♪

541
32:22.400 --> 32:24.440
Comrades, go!

542
32:24.750 --> 32:30.480
Charge!

543
32:46.660 --> 32:49.070
[Jieshou Ferry, Xiang River, Guangxi]

544
33:22.020 --> 33:23.960
[The Iron Flood]

545
33:55.010 --> 33:58.290
The frontline Red Army paid a heavy price

546
33:58.320 --> 34:00.630
and secured the Xiang River passage.

547
34:00.980 --> 34:04.380
Before dawn on December 1, 1934,

548
34:04.410 --> 34:06.640
the CPC Central Committee, the Central Revolutionary Military Commission,

549
34:06.640 --> 34:09.840
and all affiliated organs crossed the Xiang River,

550
34:10.550 --> 34:11.480
but at this time,

551
34:11.870 --> 34:14.570
there were still eight divisions that hadn't crossed.

552
34:14.570 --> 34:16.810
Except for the 15th Division, 1st Red Army Corps,

553
34:16.810 --> 34:18.980
and the 6th Division, 3rd Red Army Corps,

554
34:18.980 --> 34:22.380
the entire 5th, 8th, and 9th Red Army Corps

555
34:22.610 --> 34:24.130
had yet to cross the river.

556
34:30.120 --> 34:37.110
[Xinxu, Guangxi, Blocking Position of the 5th Division, 3rd Red Army Corps]

557
34:30.340 --> 34:32.010
Company Commander! Comrades!

558
34:32.010 --> 34:33.440
Food is here!

559
34:33.610 --> 34:34.800
Time to eat!

560
34:36.690 --> 34:38.090
Quick, Gou Yazi.

561
34:38.480 --> 34:40.739
Hand out the flatbreads to the comrades.

562
34:42.219 --> 34:42.760
Company Commander!

563
34:42.760 --> 34:43.530
Thank you!

564
34:43.900 --> 34:44.550
Here.

565
34:47.540 --> 34:48.219
Here.

566
34:48.840 --> 34:49.400
Here.

567
34:55.520 --> 34:55.920
Here you go.

568
34:55.920 --> 34:57.550
Here, have another one.

569
34:57.660 --> 34:59.480
These flatbreads were baked a long time ago.

570
34:59.480 --> 35:01.340
We just couldn't get them up here.

571
35:01.360 --> 35:01.960
Come on, eat.

572
35:01.960 --> 35:03.840
Eat more, eat more.

573
35:03.950 --> 35:06.620
These flatbreads don't have much white flour.

574
35:06.830 --> 35:08.030
It's mixed flour.

575
35:09.220 --> 35:11.220
I even added some vegetable stems.

576
35:11.460 --> 35:12.990
They're still pretty good.

577
35:13.110 --> 35:14.400
When the battle is over,

578
35:14.400 --> 35:17.320
I'll make authentic Ji'an baked flatbreads for you.

579
35:17.320 --> 35:18.450
How does that sound?

580
35:25.860 --> 35:27.230
Take cover!

581
35:37.810 --> 35:38.710
Get down!

582
35:39.690 --> 35:41.000
Watch out!

583
36:34.390 --> 36:36.310
Gou Yazi! Gou Yazi!

584
36:37.070 --> 36:39.150
Company Commander!

585
36:40.010 --> 36:41.140
Company Commander!

586
36:41.620 --> 36:42.620
Company Commander!

587
36:42.620 --> 36:44.220
Wake up, Company Commander!

588
36:44.560 --> 36:46.910
Company Commander!

589
36:47.660 --> 36:49.290
Company Commander!

590
36:50.110 --> 36:52.070
Company Commander!

591
36:59.470 --> 37:01.240
Wake up, all of you!

592
37:02.060 --> 37:04.330
Get up!

593
37:06.700 --> 37:09.410
Get up and eat!

594
37:10.470 --> 37:12.560
Get up and eat the flatbreads!

595
37:14.950 --> 37:21.670
[Jianfengling, Jiaoshanpu, Guangxi, Position of the 5th Regiment, 2nd Division, 1st Red Army Corps]

596
37:19.580 --> 37:21.430
-Commissar! -Commissar!

597
37:21.760 --> 37:23.630
-Commissar! -Commissar!

598
37:23.800 --> 37:24.460
Commissar!

599
37:24.470 --> 37:25.880
Commissar! Commissar!

600
37:25.960 --> 37:26.760
The Central Column...

601
37:26.760 --> 37:27.320
Commissar!

602
37:27.320 --> 37:28.670
How is the Central Column doing?

603
37:28.670 --> 37:29.210
Don't worry.

604
37:29.210 --> 37:31.540
They have crossed the river. Don't worry.

605
37:32.840 --> 37:34.440
Meet up with the 4th Regiment

606
37:35.220 --> 37:37.020
and break out from the flank!

607
37:37.350 --> 37:38.060
I'm not leaving!

608
37:38.060 --> 37:39.440
If you don't leave, we won't leave either!

609
37:39.440 --> 37:40.280
Right! Right!

610
37:40.280 --> 37:41.880
Commissar, if we leave, we leave together!

611
37:41.880 --> 37:43.210
Commissar! Commissar!

612
37:54.480 --> 37:56.960
I... I can't make it.

613
37:59.130 --> 38:00.130
I'll cover you!

614
38:00.360 --> 38:01.710
If we leave, we leave together!

615
38:01.710 --> 38:02.880
If we die, we die together!

616
38:02.880 --> 38:05.510
Right, let's fight them to the death!

617
38:05.510 --> 38:07.280
Go!

618
38:07.280 --> 38:09.280
Chen Fangren! Chen Fangren!

619
38:10.420 --> 38:12.350
You are the Political Instructor.

620
38:13.210 --> 38:15.270
Take the seeds of the 5th Red Regiment

621
38:15.950 --> 38:17.760
from the Jinggang Mountains

622
38:18.670 --> 38:22.590
out of here! Alive!

623
38:25.370 --> 38:27.010
This is an order!

624
38:31.870 --> 38:32.840
Retreat!

625
38:38.530 --> 38:39.780
Retreat!

626
38:55.690 --> 38:56.880
Chen Fangren!

627
38:59.940 --> 39:01.480
Take the army flag!

628
39:06.070 --> 39:06.970
Yes, sir!

629
39:17.940 --> 39:18.910
Retreat!

630
42:28.550 --> 42:32.910
[Central Column Temporary Headquarters, Jieshou, Xing'an, Guangxi]

631
42:32.950 --> 42:35.080
[Wang Jiaxiang, Vice-Chairman of the Central Revolutionary Military Commission; Director of the General Political Department of the Chinese Workers' and Peasants' Red Army]

632
42:35.080 --> 42:37.190
[Luofu (Zhang Wentian), Member of the Political Bureau Standing Committee of the CPC Central Committee; Chairman of the Central Executive Committee of the Chinese Soviet Republic]

633
42:39.490 --> 42:40.410
How is he?

634
42:40.440 --> 42:41.970
Suppurative peritonitis.

635
42:42.110 --> 42:43.970
If we don't take the shrapnel out,

636
42:44.080 --> 42:45.610
it will continue to fester.

637
42:45.670 --> 42:46.660
But given the current situation,

638
42:46.660 --> 42:47.990
we can't operate on him!

639
42:49.770 --> 42:52.120
Alright. Thank you for your hard work, Comrade Wang Bin.

640
42:52.120 --> 42:53.180
I'll take my leave.

641
42:54.850 --> 42:55.520
Jiaxiang,

642
42:55.810 --> 42:57.040
if the pain becomes unbearable,

643
42:57.040 --> 42:58.170
just scream.

644
42:59.440 --> 43:00.810
My wound hurts,

645
43:01.770 --> 43:04.170
but it hurts far less than the heartbreak everyone is feeling.
